  '- After create_buy_purchase_order, use prepare_buy_checkout only when the user wants the manual checkout URL, confirm_buy_order only after the user gives the external order id, create_buy_bill only after the user approves Bill creation from the merchant purchase, and preview_buy_accounting to check export readiness without posting journals. Pass evidence_files to create_buy_bill only when the user has uploaded file ids to attach to the Bill. Use get_buy_merchant_purchase to inspect linked Company, Purchase Order, checkout, external order, and Bill ids.',
